{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301160","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230116001:1":{"text":"솔직히, 그걸 생각해보지 않은 건 아닙니다.","source_cn":"老实说，我确实有这个打算。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4555D7DC0E653F48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230116002:1":{"text":"한동안 바다로 나가는 사람이 없었으니 자연스럽게 배를 수리할 사람도 없었죠.","source_cn":"这段时间以来没人出海，自然就没什么人需要修船。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BE8152F183D44CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230116003:1":{"text":"그런 시간이 길어지면서 수입도 없었고요... 더는 이렇게 시간을 낭비할 수 없어요.","source_cn":"这么久了，家里也没什么收入，我不能再守在这浪费时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x235DDC697F31F12D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:工匠埃隆阿":{"text":"장인 에로나","source":"工匠埃隆阿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}